From: iPool bring-up <dev@ipool>
Date: Mon, 28 Jul 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] drm/rockchip: lvds: power the LVDS DSI-DPHY at encoder enable

The backported rk3568 LVDS support powered the DSI-DPHY (in LVDS mode)
at probe time, inside rockchip_lvds_phy_probe(): phy_init +
phy_set_mode(PHY_MODE_LVDS) + phy_power_on all ran before the VOP2 pixel
clock (dclk_vp1) was running. The Rockchip vendor BSP instead powers the
PHY at encoder-enable time, after the CRTC/dclk is live, so the LVDS PHY
can lock to the incoming pixel clock. Powering it before dclk exists
leaves it unlocked -> backlight on but no image.

Match the vendor ordering: at probe only get + phy_init the PHY; do
phy_set_mode + phy_power_on in rk3568_lvds_encoder_enable() after the GRF
is configured and before enabling the panel.

Downstream (meta-ipool) fix for the RK3568 SZ3568 board's LVDS panel.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [depends on the out-of-tree rk3568 LVDS backport]
---
 drivers/gpu/drm/rockchip/rockchip_lvds.c | 21 +++++++++------------
 1 file changed, 9 insertions(+), 12 deletions(-)

--- a/drivers/gpu/drm/rockchip/rockchip_lvds.c
+++ b/drivers/gpu/drm/rockchip/rockchip_lvds.c
@@ -503,6 +503,10 @@
 		return;
 	}

+	/* meta-ipool: power the DSI-DPHY (LVDS mode) here, after dclk is live. */
+	phy_set_mode(lvds->dphy, PHY_MODE_LVDS);
+	phy_power_on(lvds->dphy);
+
 	drm_panel_enable(lvds->panel);
 }

@@ -574,21 +578,14 @@
 static int rockchip_lvds_phy_probe(struct platform_device *pdev,
 				   struct rockchip_lvds *lvds)
 {
-	int ret;
-
 	lvds->dphy = devm_phy_get(&pdev->dev, "dphy");
 	if (IS_ERR(lvds->dphy))
 		return PTR_ERR(lvds->dphy);

-	ret = phy_init(lvds->dphy);
-	if (ret)
-		return ret;
-
-	ret = phy_set_mode(lvds->dphy, PHY_MODE_LVDS);
-	if (ret)
-		return ret;
-
-	return phy_power_on(lvds->dphy);
+	/* meta-ipool: only init here; set_mode + power_on moved to encoder
+	 * enable (vendor BSP order) so the LVDS PHY powers up AFTER the VOP2
+	 * dclk is live, letting it lock to the pixel clock. */
+	return phy_init(lvds->dphy);
 }

 static int px30_lvds_probe(struct platform_device *pdev,
